flowchart LR
  REQ[acquire request\nframe or query] --> SSL[OS trust store TLS]
  SSL --> FETCH[download bytes]
  FETCH --> HASH[sha256 + byte count]
  HASH --> CACHE[(data/raw cache\ngitignored)]
  HASH --> MAN[provenance.json\nsource, url, citation, frame, time]
  CACHE --> PARSE[format parser]
  PARSE --> FIELD[typed field\nframe-tagged]
  FIELD --> GUARD{merge same frame?}
  GUARD -->|same| OK[combined field]
  GUARD -->|different| REJECT[reject: frames not comparable]
